      "content": "i know people face these things, but that doesn't change the fact that for me, the numbers literally never add up. i look at my bank account and i look at my bills and it's just a losing game. it feels less like a \"challenge\" to overcome and more like a fundamental flaw in the way things are. like, i'm just consuming resources and generating nothing but stress and debt. does any of this actually even matter if you're just drowning from day one?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
